    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d226-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d226-f1-content">
                <p>For the discussion of this paper at the 108th Meeting of the Combined Chiefs of
                    Staff, August 15, 1943, see <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg864">p. 864</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d226-f2" n="2" xml:id="d226-f2-content">
                <p>The full text of the outline plan referred to, identified as C.O.S. (43) 416 (O), is not printed. For a digest
                    of the outline plan, see the attachment to annex B, <ref target="#pg488">p.
                        488</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
